      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Mara Voss:</b> Compare what is reachable from the internet with what an authorized scanner can observe inside Northbridge's network.",
      "taskInstructions": "Read <link=\"u04_internal_external_view\"><u>internal and external assessment views</u></link>. Run <b>openvas report northbridge-internal</b> and review the banner and Results table.",
      "taskQuestion": "What changes between internal and external assessment?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Mara Voss:</b> Correct. The internal viewpoint adds hosts and services that do not answer directly from the internet.",
