        "The external view includes the public portal; the internal view also reaches the application server and SMB file share.",
        "The internal view replaces technical evidence with employee interviews only.",
        "The external view includes all internal hosts, while the internal view is limited to the homepage.",
        "The two views differ only in report formatting and must contain identical findings."
